  "limitations": "The release describes synchronized 200 Hz series. Author README missing-data notes report both current-derived torque readings missing in all trials for AB10–AB14 due to a logging bug. TCN hip moment estimates are absent for BT and ET trials. Force plate gaps can invalidate inverse dynamics. For AB01–AB09, exo records with IMU acquisition slower than 20 ms are marked missing after resampling. These files cannot establish independent actuator shaft torque or identify pre- and post-limiter commands.",
